# Where the access gate posts. Unset (the default) → the CTA is a plain link to
# the house Instagram DMs, so a request is never swallowed by a form with
# nowhere to send it. Set it to a form endpoint (Formspark, Basin, Tally,
# a Zapier/Make catch hook) and the CTA becomes an inline field that settles
# on "noted." without leaving the page.
#
# Payload: POST application/json  { "handle": "<email or @instagram>" }
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ACCESS_ENDPOINT=
